This testdef is used to test a stealth feature in mpaso introduced by
PR #8477. It simplies changes one mpaso namelist variable,
    config_gm_closure
from its default value of 'constant' to 'geometric'. It also sets
associated variables,
    config_gm_spatially_variable_max_kappa
    config_gm_spatially_variable_min_kappa
for testing.
